# The repository root .gitignore excludes *.json and *.jsonl (they are notebook
# data artifacts everywhere else in this repo). The context-lab package data is
# different: the synthetic battery and the pre-run results bundle are SOURCE.
# They must be committed, or `pip install` from the GitHub URL ships a package
# with no battery and no offline path.
#
# Negations are scoped to this package's data directory only, so the root rule
# still protects the rest of the repo.
!src/context_lab/data/
!src/context_lab/data/**/*.jsonl
!src/context_lab/data/**/*.json

# Local experiment output stays out of git.
runs/
prerun_runs/
report.md
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
